  m_text: 'Point at a part to see its name; click to isolate it and read about it. Esc or empty space clears; H toggles ghosting.


    View: drag to orbit, right-drag or Shift+drag (or WASD/arrows, Q/E) to move, scroll to zoom, double-click to centre on a spot, R to reset.


